{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the cats have taken over the cinema! Mewseum: Film Festival is a relaxing pixel art puzzle game set in a charming feline universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a featured movie, solve each grid, and gradually reveal the hidden poster. With every artwork completed, the museum fills with charm and sparkle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.poster.avif?t=1773340560\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.webm?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.mp4?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE THE PUZZLE AND REVEAL THE IMAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each grid by drawing rectangles or squares following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section you draw must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to draw.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.poster.avif?t=1773340560\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.webm?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.mp4?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VARIETY OF FILMS ON EXHIBITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 6 famous movies reimagined in the feline universe, with hundreds of puzzles to solve. Each grid offers quick sessions perfect for a casual break, or long hours of relaxing gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAX AND HAVE FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles come in different levels of difficulty depending on the grid size. If you need help, you can use hints or undo moves at any time. Relax to a cozy jazz soundtrack while discovering amazing pixel art masterpieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist now and get ready for the film festival!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985760/fca6d041e107ca992a4b8f0d7828519b76db5cf9.jpg"},{"name":"The King's Sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985760/bfad925fe1967149b942e10ab8ab2cb99e73a2fc.jpg"},{"name":"The Little Travelers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985760/e7402e9f19653113ad8b0298a46b5dc74d6751be.jpg"},{"name":"The Nine-Lives Archer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985760/b3f633de4febf0e85890a14426f08afc42709cc1.jpg"},{"name":"The Wandering Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985760/158170fb691d52b0a8a0ac92eaa2fa8988db6f8d.jpg"},{"name":"The Elf Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985760/c24f8f3b24044d7f0a86c8b4aaea3d2376d4f57f.jpg"},{"name":"The Shadow Riders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a