ly reveal the hidden poster. With every artwork completed, the museum fills with charm and sparkle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.poster.avif?t=1773340560\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.webm?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/86600bb498fe1f3f1397abed53ebe3d1.mp4?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE THE PUZZLE AND REVEAL THE IMAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each grid by drawing rectangles or squares following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section you draw must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to draw.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.poster.avif?t=1773340560\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.webm?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/extras/4e9b16ac4d84b0381acd669ad2288185.mp4?t=1773340560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VARIETY OF FILMS ON EXHIBITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 6 famous movies reimagined in the feline universe, with hundreds of puzzles to solve. Each grid offers quick sessions perfect for a casual break, or long hours of relaxing gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAX AND HAVE FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles come in different levels of difficulty depending on the grid size. If you need help, you can use hints or undo moves at any time. Relax to a cozy jazz soundtrack while discovering amazing pixel art masterpieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist now and get ready for the film festival!</strong></p>","developers":["Climbing Goat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985760/4e6810f317691ab8802c543cc26b7cf07fb80a3c/header.jpg?t=1773340560","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card supporting DirectX 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985760/65150284/6ccfdcc4015bf79b2d8aced9e80d92bda1fde4f8/1762210994/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762211405","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985760/65150284/6ccfdcc4015bf79b2d8aced9e80d92bda1fde4f8/1762210994/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762211405","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985760/65150284/6ccfdcc4015bf79b2d8aced9e80d92bda1fde4f8/1762210994/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762211405","id":257226392,"name":"Trailer Mewseum Film Festival","thumbnail":"https://s